pkg:Evidence_v1_40_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.40.0 (STORY-8 comprehensive live-content cleanup)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: fixed every genuinely live/reachable LCW/LC Waikiki reference found by systematic investigation. Highlights: BIAS_TTL/AGENTIC_TTL (subject-specific ontology constants feeding a real, live, queryable Oxigraph SPARQL engine) emptied and verified via an actual load, 235 real triples, 0 errors; the entire Provenance subview (a large narrative about the other project's own construction, ending in a literal wrong package/version stamp) replaced with a real, accurate description grounded in facts this session genuinely knows; a live WebLLM prompt and both CodeGen/TestGen system prompts corrected (the latter still contradicted STORY-14's own shipped package-installation fix). Deliberately left alone genuine historical developer comments, which are not live/user-facing and would be falsified by rewriting. Verified via the real 24/24 regression suite after each risky change, not just at the end. Version bumped correctly before committing: all 4 stages moved to v1_12_0, Cross.D verified, all real gates PASS. Confirmed the one 'v1_11_0' grep hit was the known, legitimate embedded-vocabulary false positive, not a real stale reference. Re-verified: real Playwright 0 errors, 24/24 regression suite, register still CONFORMANT."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "6b663667ccbe244ba236c298ec8a6770eccfb393fe10fff4cc76fd42f0a63011"^^xsd:string .
